message: "If you use TRACE-FV, please cite the public OSF registration."
title: "TRACE-FV v2.1: Trigger-Verified Retraction and Correction Endurance under Frame Variance - Black-Box Evaluation Protocol"
version: "2.1.0"
authors:
  - family-names: "Martirosyan"
    given-names: "Areg"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher"
